# Always deploy server changes

When you change `server/` (API, Mongo queries, auth, dashboard, etc.):

1. Commit the relevant changes (include related `mobile/` fixes in the same commit when they belong together).
2. Push to `origin` on the current branch (`master` unless told otherwise) so Vercel/GitHub production deploy runs.
3. Tell the user the push/deploy was triggered and that no Play Store rebuild is required for server-only fixes.

Do not wait to be asked to deploy after server fixes — treat deploy as part of finishing the task.
